From: John Drummond <john.drummond@ultra-sss.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Tests: terrain camera / pointer primitives, terrain tile cover, elevated frustum boxes

Unit tests (no library code changes) for patch 0053 (TransformState::screenCoordinateToLatLngAtElevation,
raycastTerrain, Map::setLocationAtPoint / latLngForPixelAtElevation, Transform::putCenterOnTerrainKeepingCamera)
and for the elevation-aware tile cover (patch 0040): variable-zoom terrain LOD, per-tile elevation ranges in the
frustum test, and Frustum with boxes that span a z (elevation) range.

